WEBVTT

00:00:07.276 --> 00:00:08.062
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Hi, Dave.

00:00:09.022 --> 00:00:11.094
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Hi, Becca. Hi, Barry!

00:00:11.924 --> 00:00:13.924
So nice to see you both again!

00:00:14.624 --> 00:00:17.248
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> What a cute restaurant. I really like it.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.184
And look at all the dogs.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.248
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> I know, right!

00:00:20.571 --> 00:00:24.275
It has good food, too…for people and for dogs!

00:00:24.276 --> 00:00:27.204
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Mmm. Sit, Barry. Good boy.

00:00:27.568 --> 00:00:28.957
Uh, where’s Dolly?

00:00:29.479 --> 00:00:30.677
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> She isn’t here.

00:00:31.249 --> 00:00:34.249
Uh, Becca, I need to tell you something.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:38.064
Dolly isn’t my dog. She’s my friend’s dog.

00:00:38.172 --> 00:00:40.731
I sometimes help and take her for a walk.

00:00:41.143 --> 00:00:42.396
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> You don’t have a dog?

00:00:42.706 --> 00:00:46.525
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> No. Uh…I don’t like dogs very much.

00:00:46.803 --> 00:00:48.889
And my apartment’s so small.

00:00:49.159 --> 00:00:51.869
I’m so sorry. I know you love dogs.

00:00:52.232 --> 00:00:53.956
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Phew! Don’t worry!

00:00:54.044 --> 00:00:57.634
Barry isn’t my dog either! He’s my sister’s dog.

00:00:58.022 --> 00:01:01.830
I like dogs, but…in fact…I have two cats.

00:01:02.211 --> 00:01:03.857
How do you feel about cats?

00:01:04.023 --> 00:01:08.233
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> I love cats – in fact, I prefer cats to dogs!

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:10.631
Let’s sit down and order lunch.

00:01:10.901 --> 00:01:11.464
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Great!

00:01:12.019 --> 00:01:13.336
So, what’s good here?

00:01:13.828 --> 00:01:16.799
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> The spaghetti carbonara is fantastic –

00:01:17.188 --> 00:01:19.592
and so is the homemade chocolate ice cream!

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:22.347
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Yum! All for me this time!